aside on :aside:side-a,a phrase::.

:note: {:label: fn-a} The footnote text. ::

:aside: {:label: side-a} The aside text. ::

:figure: {
  :label: fig-a
  :path: figure-light.png
}
:caption: A figure a reader can pin.
::

